      "text": "WHEREAS, it is deemed desirable that pending the enactment of such legislation that the Health Services Administrator, in the interests of greater efficiency, be in a position to coordinate the activities of the Addiction Services Agency with the health programs relating to drug addiction presently administered by the Health Services Administration.",
