      "text": "SECTION 1. There shall continue to be in the office of the Mayor a bureau or division which shall be known as the Addiction Services Agency. This agency shall continue to be headed by a Commissioner known as the Commissioner of Addiction Services. There shall continue to be in such agency three Deputy Commissioners, one of whom shall be known as the First Deputy Commissioner.",
